 y="258" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#7C2D12" text-anchor="middle">JVM</text><text x="920" y="342" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Executes bytecode, platform</text><text x="920" y="362" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">independently</text><text x="1290" y="215" class="m" xml:space="preserve" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="middle">10101010  01010101</text><text x="1290" y="243" class="m" xml:space="preserve" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="middle">11001100  10101010</text><text x="1290" y="271" class="m" xml:space="preserve" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="middle">01010101  11001100</text><text x="1290" y="299" class="m" xml:space="preserve" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="middle">10101010  01010101</text><text x="1290" y="342" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Interpreted first; hot code is</text><text x="1290" y="362" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">JIT-compiled to machine code</text><rect x="1595.0" y="208.0" width="130" height="84" rx="6" fill="#1F2937"/><rect x="1601.0" y="214.0" width="118" height="72" rx="3" fill="#E0F2FE"/><path d="M1646 306.0 h28 M1660 292.0 v14" stroke="#1F2937" stroke-width="5"/><text x="1660" y="255" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#0F2A4A" text-anchor="middle">Hello World</text><text x="1660" y="342" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Displayed on the screen</text><path d="M30 432 H1810" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="8 6"/><rect x="640" y="414" width="560" height="36" rx="18" fill="#fff"/><text x="920" y="440" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#1D4ED8" text-anchor="middle">JDK, JRE, JVM Relationship</text><rect x="30" y="470" width="460" height="540" rx="18" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="3"/><text x="55" y="508" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#1D4ED8" text-anchor="start">JDK (Java Development Kit)</text><text x="55" y="540" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">A complete package for Java development. It</text><text x="55" y="562" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">contains the JRE plus development tools.</text><text x="55" y="605" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#1D4ED8" text-anchor="start">JDK contains:</text><rect x="55" y="620" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="629" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#2563EB"/><text x="104" y="649" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">JRE</tspan> (Java Runtime Environment)</text><rect x="55" y="672" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="681" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#059669"/><text x="104" y="701" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">javac</tspan> (Compiler)</text><rect x="55" y="724" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="733" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#EA580C"/><text x="104" y="753" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">java</tspan> (Launcher: starts the JVM)</text><rect x="55" y="776" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="785" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#7C3AED"/><text x="104" y="805" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">jdb</tspan> (Debugger)</text><rect x="55" y="828" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="837" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#D97706"/><text x="104" y="857" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">jar</tspan> (Archiver)</text><rect x="55" y="880" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="889" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#0891B2"/><text x="104" y="909" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">javadoc</tspan> (Documentation)</text><rect x="55" y="932" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#BFDBFE" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="65" y="941" width="26" height="26" rx="6" fill="#6B7280"/><text x="104" y="961" class="s" font-size="16" fill="#1F2937"><tspan font-weight="700">jshell, jlink, jcmd</tspan> (and more tools)</text><rect x="530" y="470" width="460" height="540" rx="18" fill="#ECFDF5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="3"/><text x="555" y="508" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#047857" text-anchor="start">JRE (Java Runtime Environment)</text><text x="555" y="540" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">Provides the environment to run Java</text><text x="555" y="562" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">applications: the JVM plus core libraries.</text><text x="555" y="605" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#047857" text-anchor="start">JRE contains:</text><rect x="555" y="620" width="205" height="250" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#6EE7B7" stroke-width="2"/><text x="657" y="648" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="19" font-weight="800" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="middle">JVM</text><text x="657" y="668" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">(Java Virtual Machine)</text><rect x="612.0" y="710.0" width="90" height="60" rx="6" fill="#1F2937"/><rect x="618.0" y="716.0" width="78" height="48" rx="3" fill="#E0F2FE"/><path d="M643 784.0 h28 M657 770.0 v14" stroke="#1F2937" stroke-width="5"/><text x="657" y="820" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Executes bytecode and runs</text><text x="657" y="838" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">it as machine code.</text><rect x="775" y="620" width="190" height="250" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#6EE7B7" stroke-width="2"/><text x="870" y="648" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="19" font-weight="800" fill="#047857" text-anchor="middle">Core Libraries</text><text x="870" y="668" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">(API classes)</text><rect x="842.0" y="700.0" width="56.0" height="80" rx="5" fill="#D1FAE5" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M854.0 724.0 h32.0 M854.0 740 h32.0 M854.0 756.0 h20.0" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3"/><text x="870" y="820" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">java.lang, java.util,</text><text x="870" y="838" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">java.io and more.</text><rect x="555" y="885" width="410" height="44" rx="8" fill="#D1FAE5" stroke="#6EE7B7" stroke-width="2"/><text x="760" y="913" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="600" fill="#065F46" text-anchor="middle">Other supporting files (config, security, properties)</text><text x="555" y="958" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4B5563" text-anchor="start">Since Java 9 there is no separate JRE download. Use</text><text x="555" y="976" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4B5563" text-anchor="start">jlink to build a custom runtime.</text><rect x="1030" y="470" width="520" height="540" rx="18" fill="#F5F3FF" stroke="#7C3AED" stroke-width="3"/><text x="1055" y="508" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="start">JVM (Java Virtual Machine)</text><text x="1055" y="540" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">The heart of Java. It executes bytecode and makes</text><text x="1055" y="562" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">Java platform independent.</text><text x="1055" y="600" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="start">How the JVM works:</text><rect x="1055" y="615" width="470" height="62" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#0F766E" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1290" y="641" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#0F766E" text-anchor="middle">1. Class Loader Subsystem</text><text x="1290" y="663" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Loads .class files, then links and initializes them</text><path d="M1290 679 L1290 691" stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a6B7280)"/><rect x="1055" y="693" width="470" height="62" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1290" y="719" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#2563EB" text-anchor="middle">2. Bytecode Verifier</text><text x="1290" y="741" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Checks bytecode for safety and correctness (linking)</text><path d="M1290 757 L1290 769" stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a6B7280)"/><rect x="1055" y="771" width="470" height="62" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#B45309" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1290" y="797" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#B45309" text-anchor="middle">3. Runtime Data Areas</text><text x="1290" y="819" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Heap, stack, PC register, Metaspace</text><path d="M1290 835 L1290 847" stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a6B7280)"/><rect x="1055" y="849" width="470" height="62" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#6D28D9" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1290" y="875" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#6D28D9" text-anchor="middle">4. Execution Engine</text><text x="1290" y="897" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Interpreter plus JIT compiler run the bytecode</text><path d="M1290 913 L1290 925" stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a6B7280)"/><rect x="1055" y="927" width="470" height="62" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#BE123C" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1290" y="953" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#BE123C" text-anchor="middle">5. Garbage Collector</text><text x="1290" y="975" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">Automatically frees unreachable objects on the heap</text><rect x="1570" y="470" width="240" height="540" rx="18" fill="#FAFAF5" stroke="#9CA3AF" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="1610" cy="512" r="14" fill="#FACC15"/><rect x="1604" y="525" width="12" height="8" rx="2" fill="#9CA3AF"/><text x="1635" y="518" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="20" font-weight="800" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Key Points</text><circle cx="1595" cy="570" r="12" fill="#EA580C"/><text x="1618" y="568" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Source code is</text><text x="1618" y="588" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">compiled to bytecode</text><text x="1618" y="608" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">(.class).</text><circle cx="1595" cy="678" r="12" fill="#2563EB"/><text x="1618" y="676" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Bytecode is platform</text><text x="1618" y="696" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">independent. Each OS</text><text x="1618" y="716" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">has its own JVM.</text><circle cx="1595" cy="786" r="12" fill="#7C3AED"/><text x="1618" y="784" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">The JVM turns</text><text x="1618" y="804" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">bytecode into</text><text x="1618" y="824" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">machine code</text><text x="1618" y="844" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">(interpreter + JIT).</text><circle cx="1595" cy="894" r="12" fill="#16A34A"/><text x="1618" y="892" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">So Java is write</text><text x="1618" y="912" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">once, run anywhere.</text><rect x="30" y="1040" width="520" height="225" rx="18" fill="#FFFBEB" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="3"/><text x="55" y="1076" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#92400E" text-anchor="start">Where It Is Used</text><circle cx="62" cy="1106" r="4" fill="#92400E"/><text x="78" y="1112" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Desktop apps (e.g., IntelliJ IDEA)</text><circle cx="62" cy="1138" r="4" fill="#92400E"/><text x="78" y="1144" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Web apps (e.g., Spring Boot)</text><circle cx="62" cy="1170" r="4" fill="#92400E"/><text x="78" y="1176" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Android (Java/Kotlin, runs on ART, not a JVM)</text><circle cx="62" cy="1202" r="4" fill="#92400E"/><text x="78" y="1208" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Enterprise applications</text><circle cx="62" cy="1234" r="4" fill="#92400E"/><text x="78" y="1240" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="16" font-weight="400" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="start">Big data, cloud, embedded (e.g., Kafka, Hadoop)</text><rect x="580" y="1040" width="440" height="225" rx="18" fill="#FFFBEB" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="3"/><text x="605" y="1076" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#92400E" text-anchor="start">Platform Independence</text><text x="605" y="1104" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">The same bytecode runs on different operating</text><text x="605" y="1124" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">systems because a JVM exists for every major</text><text x="605" y="1144" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="start">platform.</text><rect x="637" y="1160" width="56" height="44" rx="8" fill="#2563EB"/><text x="665" y="1222" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="middle">Windows</text><rect x="777" y="1160" width="56" height="44" rx="8" fill="#1F2937"/><text x="805" y="1222" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="middle">Linux</text><rect x="917" y="1160" width="56" height="44" rx="8" fill="#6B7280"/><text x="945" y="1222" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="middle">macOS</text><text x="605" y="1252" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4B5563" text-anchor="start">JVM implementations: HotSpot, OpenJ9, GraalVM</text><rect x="1050" y="1040" width="760" height="225" rx="18" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="3"/><text x="1075" y="1076" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="22" font-weight="800" fill="#1D4ED8" text-anchor="start">Complete Flow (In Short)</text><rect x="1096.8" y="1124.0" width="36.4" height="52" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M1104.6 1139.6 h20.8 M1104.6 1150 h20.8 M1104.6 1160.4 h13.0" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3"/><text x="1115" y="1215" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="middle">Source Code</text><text x="1115" y="1234" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">(.java)</text><path d="M1151 1150 L1203 1150" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#a111827)"/><circle cx="1240" cy="1150" r="24" fill="none" stroke="#9CA3AF" stroke-width="9.600000000000001" stroke-dasharray="8.399999999999999 6.0"/><circle cx="1240" cy="1150" r="20.4" fill="#9CA3AF" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="1240" cy="1150" r="8.399999999999999" fill="#fff" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="3"/><text x="1240" y="1215" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#1F2937" text-anchor="middle">Compiler</text><text x="1240" y="1234" class="s" xml:space="preserve" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#374151" text-anchor="middle">(javac)</text><path d="M1276 1150 L1328 1150" stroke="#111827" stroke-w